      "side": 0,
      "message": "The LINK_KEY_REQUEST is part of the Authentication procedure, not the Pairing one,\nThe responder/acceptor of a pairing never gets a LINK_KEY_REQUEST. You can see that in the message sequence chart for the Secure Simple Pairing (Core spec, Vol 2, Part F, 4.2.6) the Host B being the responder. This is also the case for legacy pairing (pin pairing), I\u0027m unable to find a sequence chart in the core spec but you can see it in the sequence chart of the LMP Test Suite for the LMP/AUT/BV-05-C test",
